1
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:09,140
It's Twilight time

2
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,060
Out of the east...

3
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:12,920
Wanda and Vision, aren't we a fine pair?

4
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:13,860
Yes.

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:14,680
This is our home now.

6
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,280
I want us to fit in.

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:19,000
Oh, this is gonna be a gas!

8
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:20,480
Where did you two move from?

9
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,900
How long have you been married,

10
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,940
and why don't you have children yet?

11
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,240
Our story.

12
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:28,500
I think what my wife means to say is that we moved

13
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,160
from...

14
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:29,660
Moved from where?

15
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:30,700
Married when?

16
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:32,600
Damn it, why?

17
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:34,900
Oh, Arthur, stop it.

18
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,080
Stop it!

19
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:37,800
Stop it! Stop it!

20
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,500
This is really happening.

21
00:00:52,970 --> 00:00:54,150
Am I dead?

22
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:54,850
No.

23
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:56,770
Why would you think that?

24
00:00:57,310 --> 00:00:58,250
Because you are.

25
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:10,920
Usual couple, you know?

26
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:12,820
Oh, I don't think that was ever in question.
